  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e05-scene-01",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "素顔のほうがステキだ  (Your Natural Face Is Lovely)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "client_f": "女性客",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome back to The Naked Director, Season Two, Episode Five. Alone on a closed set with the newcomer who volunteered to replace Kuroki, Muranishi tells her to cast off every rule holding her back and gives her a brand-new stage name.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "リラックスして。ここには誰も入ってこない、二人だけの空間。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まずは君を飾ってるすべてを剥ぎ取る。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "常識もルールも、君を縛るすべてを捨て去るんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "素顔のほうがステキだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "私、最初から一作目は村西さんに撮ってもらうって決めてました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうならなかったらどうしてたんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "どんな手を使っても、撮ってもらうつもりでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いい表情だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "少し表情が硬いかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "肩の力を抜いて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "さあ、一歩を踏み出す瞬間ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "リラックスして。ここには誰も入ってこない、二人だけの空間。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Relax. Nobody will come in here—this space belongs just to the two of us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まずは君を飾ってるすべてを剥ぎ取る。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'First, we strip away everything dressing you up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "常識もルールも、君を縛るすべてを捨て去るんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Common sense and rules—cast away everything that ties you down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "素顔のほうがステキだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your unadorned face is much lovelier.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "私、最初から一作目は村西さんに撮ってもらうって決めてました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From the very beginning, I had decided to have you film my first work, Mr. Muranishi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうならなかったらどうしてたんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What would you have done if it hadn't turned out that way?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "どんな手を使っても、撮ってもらうつもりでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I intended to have you film me no matter what means it took.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いい表情だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's a great look on your face.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "少し表情が硬いかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your expression still looks a bit stiff.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "肩の力を抜いて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let the tension out of your shoulders.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "さあ、一歩を踏み出す瞬間ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now then, this is the moment to take that first step forward.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
